  "bodyText": "RADIO\nLATEST\nEXPLORE\nINFINITE MIXTAPES\nSHOP\nNTS SUPPORTERS\nMY NTS\nLIVE NOW\n1\n2\nJOHN CARPENTER, CODY CARPENTER & DANIEL DAVIES\nHEAVY METAL · HARD ROCK\nSelections from the horror master and close collaborators.\nVLAP: TIAKOLA\nRAP\nFrench titan Tiakola live in the VLAP studio.\nNTS GUIDE TO: TRIPS TO YOUR SOUL\nPSYCHEDELIC SOUL · FUNK · BOOGIE\nTrippy vintage soul, funk, and boogie, dusty drum machines and more.\nKLEIN\nEXPERIMENTAL · AMBIENT\nKlein presents a warped public service announcement.\nSKYAPNEA W/ RAMZILLA\nELECTRONICA · AMBIENT\nA 2-hour dubbed out dancefloor trip.\nIN FOCUS: KOUROSH YAGHMAEI\nPSYCHEDELIC ROCK\nSounds from the king of Iranian psych rock.\nSILVIA KASTEL\nELECTRONICA · AMBIENT\nSpacious ambient and sparkling electronics.\nDEEP MEDI W/ COKI\nDUBSTEP\nA special mix from a dubstep originator.\nAS I WAS MOVING AHEAD – TESFAYE (A FUTURE HOPE)\nLUK THUNG · CLASSICAL · ETHIOPIAN POP\n\"Collecting unexpected resonances between Ethiopian, Eritrean, Khmer, Thai and Lao musical traditions, from one valley to another.\"\nO0O\nCLOUD RAP\n60 minutes of cutting edge original productions.\nVRITNI\nELECTRONICA · EXPERIMENTAL HIP HOP\nAn expansive hour of original edits and club mutations from the South American crew.\nNTS SESSION: ERYKAH BADU & THE ALCHEMIST\nSOUL · HIP-HOP\nErykah Badu and The Alchemist video performance of new music for NTS.\nWATCH\nDOLLY PARTON COLLECTION\nCOUNTRY\nEveryone loves Dolly.\nFULL COLLECTION\nRESIDENT PICKS: A COLOURFUL STORM\nMoopie is next up in the series, diving into the NTS radio archives to pick out shows that inspire what he does.\nEXPLORE\nATONEMO NTS RADIO PLAYER\nMake NTS part of your home hi-fi system with the NTS Atonemo Radio Player.\nSHOP NOW\n1 / 15\nINFINITE MIXTAPES\n\nMusic-only themed radio streams, made from NTS resident and guest shows\n\nPOOLSIDE\n\nBalearic, boogie, and sophisti-pop for poolsides, beaches and car stereos.\n\nSLOW FOCUS\n\nMeditative, relaxing and beatless: ambient, drone and ragas.\n\nLOW KEY\n\nKeeping it simple with lo-fi hip-hop and smooth R’n’B.\n\nMEMORY LANE\n\nTurn on, tune in, drop out.\n\n4 TO THE FLOOR\n\nHouse and techno from past to present.\n\nISLAND TIME\n\nEasy skanking - reggae, dub, and plenty more.\n\nTHE TUBE\n\nOddball post-punk, industrial provocation, and minimal wave.\n\nSHEET MUSIC\n\nThe best of classical and contemporary composition.\n\nFEELINGS\n\nSweet soul, gospel, boogie, and beyond.\n\nEXPANSIONS\n\nJazz and its many mind-expanding variations.\n\nRAP HOUSE\n\n808s and champagne.\n\nLABYRINTH\n\nEnter the void.\n\nSWEAT\n\nA new wave of international party music.\n\nOTAKU\n\nVideo game and anime soundtracks, for fanboys and fangirls.\n\nTHE PIT\n\nBehold the songs of the ancient metal bards.\n\nFIELD RECORDINGS\n\nNatural ambience from NTS listeners around the world.\n\nNTS PICKSVIEW ALL \n29 SEP 2026\nLONDON\nLORAINE JAMES\nAMBIENT\nMODERN CLASSICAL\n26 SEP 2026\nLOS ANGELES\nBORN FOR BURNING - COLD RIFFS AND DEMON FURY\nDEATH METAL\nBLACK METAL\n01 OCT 2026\nLONDON\nLA VIDA ES UN MUS W/ HARPER\nPSYCHEDELIC ROCK\nGARAGE ROCK\n22 SEP 2026\nLONDON\nTONE\nAFROBEATS\nSOUL\nRAP\nRNB\n24 SEP 2026\nLONDON\nNTS GUIDE TO: BAITHAK GANA\nBAITHAK GANA\n29 SEP 2026\nLOS ANGELES\nJOHN CARPENTER, CODY CARPENTER & DANIEL DAVIES\nHEAVY METAL\nHARD ROCK\n27 SEP 2026\nSUPPORTER RADIO•MONTEVIDEO\nBEDROOM DRIVEN ROMANTIK BEATS W/ LUISA\nELECTRONICA\nREGGAETON\n26 SEP 2026\nSUPPORTER RADIO•BARCELONA\nLA MOVIDA W/ COURTS\nNEW WAVE\nSYNTH POP\nNTS SHOPVIEW ALL \nBUILT FOR MUSIC LOVERS, BY MUSIC LOVERS\nBECOME AN NTS SUPPORTER\nCOLLECTIONSVIEW ALL \n\nThemed playlists showcasing the breadth of the NTS archive. Curated by NTS.\n\nNEWS & EVENTS\nLISTEN ON THE NTS APP\nNTS\nAbout\nCareers\nHelp and Feedback\nSupport NTS\nGift NTS Supporters\nSTAY UP TO DATE\nSubscribe for recent radio highlights, one-off events, goods drops and much more…\nEmail Address\nI agree to receive emails from NTS, and have read and understood the Privacy Policy.\nSUBSCRIBE\nFREE. NO ADS. 24/7\nPrivacy PolicyTerms and Conditions\nCOOKIES\n\nBy clicking “Accept All Cookies”, you agree to the storing of cookies on your device to enhance site navigation, analyze site usage, and assist in our marketing efforts.\n\nACCEPT ALL COOKIES\nMANAGE PREFERENCES",
